Register User — New Field Requirements: dateOfBirth

Change: Field is_adult (boolean) is replaced with dateOfBirth to capture the user’s exact date of birth.

Endpoint: POST /auth/register

Field Specification

Property
Value
Field name
`dateOfBirth`
Data type
string
Format
YYYY-MM-DD (ISO 8601)
Required
Yes
Example 
`1990-05-20`



Validation Rules

Rule
Error message
Field is required
`dateOfBirth is required`
Format must be YYYY-MM-DD
`Invalid date format. Use YYYY-MM-DD`
Date cannot be in the future
`dateOfBirth cannot be a future date`
User must be 18 or older
`User must be at least 18 years old`



Error Response (400)

{
"code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
"field": "dateOfBirth",
"message": "User must be at least 18 years old"
} 
